  "method": "Cell Ranger-compatible GeneFull single-cell RNA quantification on PBMC10K, glioma, organoid, and MSK ES GEX-only. Cell Ranger 9.0.1 and CellGENI STARsolo outputs and times are retained. MSK GEX-only is an auxiliary session-consistency arm. Cell-call Jaccard, per-cell UMI totals, log-count cell profiles, and raw shared-gene totals are recomputed from the new matrices. The corrected 1.9.5 tag was built with the accepted benchmark recipe and one SHA256-identified binary was used everywhere. Scientific arguments, input formats, reference content, hash caches, and caller settings were preserved. Each arm ran once on a quiet host, with fresh outputs and a fatal cold-cache preflight. All input, reference, output, temporary and spill locations were checked against the intended storage. Comparator outputs and times were retained; no comparator was rerun. Completion, executed-command identity, the 1.30 maximum timing ratio, and canonical correlation/cell-call tolerances were checked before scheduling the next arm. Byte equality is a recorded diagnostic rather than an acceptance gate.",
